      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The first public school, Camey Elementary, opened in 1977, followed by the public library in 1982, marking the start of modern civic life.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
