      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The city was incorporated in January 1977 and became a home‑rule city two years later, reflecting rapid growth after Frisco annexation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28,
